{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_5_level_main_05-01_beg",
  "groupId": "main_5",
  "stageId": "main_05-01",
  "title": "冤家易结",
  "storyCode": "5-1",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "89eda0843b9b9a11d9826813c29933a6f546ef733e70af6a67536ee54c319db8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以后我们就是朋友了。现在那些大人们，再也没办法欺负我们了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别害怕，从今天开始无论发生什么，我都会帮你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我遇到什么坏事情，你可也一定要帮我哦！这就是朋友！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿嘿，我们不会分开的，对吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你还记得那个老公爵掳走她时你做了什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你为了龙门能做到哪一步，是否真的什么都可以？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在，魏彦吾，你又要牺牲谁、牺牲什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "喂，醒醒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "救她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "陈警司，醒醒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......让我过去！让我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "*龙门粗口*，我哪有时间和你这么耗下去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哗啦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "噗，咳，咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "醒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "怎么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "星熊，快！整合运动——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "白日梦做够了吗？真是的，一脸败相。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "怎么是你？我的队伍呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "如果我说全灭了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "想挨打的话，建议去整合运动后面排队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "嘴上功夫一直厉害得很，战场上怎么见不到你这么凶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "你们怎么回事？我才走开一小会儿，你们两个就又吵架吵成这个样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "Miss.诗怀雅，少讽刺她两句对你没坏处，真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "老陈你也是，才刚醒就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "等等，你怎么湿得跟刚被园艺车浇过一样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你问她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "“小姐”，这空杯子是怎么回事？我记得我给你们两个人各倒了一杯水？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "她梦里说胡话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "搞什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我们在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "罗德岛的某个舱室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "三刻钟前，陈警司，你和你的小队逃窜回了龙门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "你可能觉得你们把自己的行踪隐藏得很好，但徘徊在龙门外围的整合运动并不这么想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
